OL,5,G1440 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FDoc and Lucia want to split their
OL,7,     Ftime between the beautiful,
OL,8,     Fwhitewashed town of Alora in
OL,9,     Fsouthern Spain, and backpacking
OL,10,     Faround the world. Laura Hamilton
OL,11,     Fshows them what #110k can buy.
